  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Beredskapsfinansiering f&#xf6;r internationella insatser</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparedness funds for MSB:s international operations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntade resultatet &#xe4;r att MSB har kapacitet att initiera, hantera och leda insatser</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected results is to ensure capacity at HQ level at MSB to administer and manage projects to save lives, alleviate suffering and contribute to increased secruity and reconstruction.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rvaltningskostnader f&#xf6;r beredskap, denna post t&#xe4;cker till exempel utbildning av insatspersonal, utveckling av materiel och logistikverktyg etc.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This post covers MSB&#xb4;s indirect costs to secure that the agency is prepared to engage in international aid operations. The post covers for example training of field staff, development of solutions for equipment and logistics, internal functions at the agency etc</narrative>
  </description>
